# Task 2.7 — browser error tracking (Sentry project: voice-agent-frontend).
#
# Committed on purpose, unlike backend/.env. A frontend DSN is not a
# credential: Vite inlines VITE_* variables at build time, so this string
# ships inside the JS bundle that every visitor downloads regardless. It is
# a write-only ingest identifier — it can be used to SEND events to this
# project, never to read them, and it grants no access to the Sentry
# account. Keeping it here means a server build picks it up automatically
# instead of depending on someone remembering to export a shell variable.
#
# Deliberately a SEPARATE Sentry project from the backend: mixing a browser
# and a Python service in one project breaks per-platform issue grouping.
VITE_SENTRY_DSN=https://e6b2604cbf1a564f68baedb5afe5e4a8@o4512012347703296.ingest.us.sentry.io/4512016417816576
